  "description": "Huazhi was put to death due to her family's betrayal. A girl who was from a prestigious family a thousand years ago was reincarnated as Huazhi. She tried to live a comfortable life away from betrayals and dark battles... but the family fell apart in an instant, and Huazhi tried reestablish the family using the experiences of his previous life. And then, a man who is attracted to her, like fate, arrives in her unsuccessful life...\n\n**Note: This Korean webtoon is based on a Chinese novel called The Story of Huazhi which has been adapted into a Chinese drama called, \"Blossoms in Adversity.\"**\n\n**Korean Translation of the Original Chinese Novel:**  \n•Naver Series: [Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5418678), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6009913)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8586657), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000053625), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60762247), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3372009205), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H043049620), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H043049620)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/16382)",
